---
description: ESLint practices for Next.js v15 (eslint-config-next ^15.5.3, ESLint ^8)
globs: **/*.tsx,**/*.ts,**/*.js,**/*.jsx
---

- Extend `next/core-web-vitals` and project-specific overrides sparingly.
- Enable TypeScript linting; keep `no-unused-vars`, `no-undef`, and import/order sane.
- Integrate Prettier via `eslint-config-prettier` to avoid conflicts.
- Run ESLint in CI; treat errors as blocking.
- Keep plugin versions aligned with Next/TS versions.

